# Grenade: throw one at the ground ahead of the zombies with G, wait out the fuse, and check the blast.
# A round 1 zombie has 100 health and the blast does 250 at the centre, so a zombie near the blast dies and pays a hit plus the kill bonus.
# The throw is early, while the zombies are far, because a grenade that hits a zombie bounces back. The blast goes off 150 frames after the throw, when the nearest zombie has walked up to it.
expect hud.grenades 2
expect hud.points 0
until zombies.alive 4 300
wait 40
aim
look 0 220
state 01-before
shot 01-before
tap grenade
expect hud.grenades 1
wait 30
look 0 -190
shot 02-flying
wait 123
state 03-blast
shot 03-blast
wait 60
state 04-after
shot 04-after
expect_not hud.points 0
expect_not zombies.alive 4
expect hud.grenades 1
